<title>THAILAND: Serm Suk pays 9.50 baht div for '96.</title>
<headline>Serm Suk pays 9.50 baht div for '96.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dividend for year ending December 31, 1996:</p>
<p>			  Twelve months</p>
<p>    Div (baht)	  9.50   vs   11.00</p>
<p>    Ex-dividend	 April 2, 1997</p>
<p>    Payment date	N.A.</p>
<p>Note: Company's full name is Serm Suk Plc, a soft drink manufacturing company.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
